  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 3561,
   "end": 3579,
   "text": "## Available tasks",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 3581,
   "end": 3806,
   "text": "RoboTwin 2.0 ships 50 dual-arm manipulation tasks in its upstream ⟦0⟧ directory. The canonical list is the ⟦1⟧ tuple in ⟦2⟧, mirrored verbatim from the upstream repo. Example tasks:",
   "tokens": [
    "`envs/`",
    "`ROBOTWIN_TASKS`",
    "`src/lerobot/envs/robotwin.py`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 3808,
   "end": 3883,
   "text": "| Task                     | CLI name                 | Category          |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 3960,
   "end": 4035,
   "text": "| Beat block with hammer   | ⟦0⟧      | Tool use          |",
   "tokens": [
    "`beat_block_hammer`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4036,
   "end": 4111,
   "text": "| Click bell / alarm clock | ⟦0⟧             | Precision press   |",
   "tokens": [
    "`click_bell`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 20,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4112,
   "end": 4187,
   "text": "| Stack blocks (2 / 3)     | ⟦0⟧ | Stacking          |",
   "tokens": [
    "`stack_blocks_two/three`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4188,
   "end": 4263,
   "text": "| Stack bowls (2 / 3)      | ⟦0⟧  | Stacking          |",
   "tokens": [
    "`stack_bowls_two/three`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 22,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4264,
   "end": 4339,
   "text": "| Handover block / mic     | ⟦0⟧         | Bimanual coord.   |",
   "tokens": [
    "`handover_block`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 23,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4340,
   "end": 4415,
   "text": "| Lift pot                 | ⟦0⟧               | Bimanual lift     |",
   "tokens": [
    "`lift_pot`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 24,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4416,
   "end": 4491,
   "text": "| Shake bottle             | ⟦0⟧           | Continuous motion |",
   "tokens": [
    "`shake_bottle`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 25,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4492,
   "end": 4567,
   "text": "| Turn switch              | ⟦0⟧            | Articulated obj   |",
   "tokens": [
    "`turn_switch`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 26,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4568,
   "end": 4643,
   "text": "| Stamp seal               | ⟦0⟧             | Precision place   |",
   "tokens": [
    "`stamp_seal`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 27,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4644,
   "end": 4719,
   "text": "| Scan object              | ⟦0⟧            | Mobile manip.     |",
   "tokens": [
    "`scan_object`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 28,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 4721,
   "end": 4810,
   "text": "Pass a comma-separated list to ⟦0⟧ to run multiple tasks in a single eval sweep.",
   "tokens": [
    "`--env.task`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 29,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 4812,
   "end": 5162,
   "text": "⟦0⟧\n  ⟦1⟧ is currently broken upstream (its ⟦2⟧ uses\n  ⟦3⟧, which is only set inside the scripted-expert ⟦4⟧\n  path and therefore unavailable during normal policy eval). Avoid it until the\n  upstream bug is fixed, or patch the task to default ⟦5⟧ in\n  ⟦6⟧.",
   "tokens": [
    "<Tip warning={true}>",
    "`open_laptop`",
    "`check_success()`",
    "`self.arm_tag`",
    "`play_once()`",
    "`self.arm_tag = \"left\"`",
    "`load_actors()`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 30,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 5171,
   "end": 5181,
   "text": "## Dataset",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 31,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 5183,
   "end": 5272,
   "text": "The RoboTwin 2.0 dataset is available in **LeRobot v3.0 format** on the Hugging Face Hub:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 32,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 5308,
   "end": 5535,
   "text": "It contains over 100,000 pre-collected trajectories across all 50 tasks (79.6 GB, Apache 2.0 license). No format conversion is needed — it is already in the correct LeRobot v3.0 schema with video observations and action labels.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 33,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 5537,
   "end": 5591,
   "text": "You can load it directly with the HF Datasets library:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 34,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 5704,
   "end": 5719,
   "text": "## Installation",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 35,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 5721,
   "end": 5841,
   "text": "RoboTwin 2.0 requires **Linux** with an NVIDIA GPU (CUDA 12.1 recommended). Installation takes approximately 20 minutes.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 36,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 5843,
   "end": 5876,
   "text": "### 1. Create a conda environment",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 37,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 5955,
   "end": 5977,
   "text": "### 2. Install LeRobot",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 38,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 6075,
   "end": 6102,
   "text": "### 3. Install RoboTwin 2.0",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 39,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 6245,
   "end": 6343,
   "text": "The install script handles all Python dependencies including SAPIEN, CuRobo, mplib, and pytorch3d.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 40,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 6345,
   "end": 6415,
   "text": "⟦0⟧\nIf the automated install fails, install manually:",
   "tokens": [
    "<Tip warning={true}>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 41,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 6646,
   "end": 6754,
   "text": "Then apply the required mplib fix: in ⟦0⟧ line 807, remove ⟦1⟧ from the conditional.",
   "tokens": [
    "`mplib/planner.py`",
    "`or collide`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 42,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 6764,
   "end": 6797,
   "text": "### 4. Add RoboTwin to PYTHONPATH",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 43,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 6799,
   "end": 6894,
   "text": "The RoboTwin task modules must be importable by LeRobot. From within the ⟦0⟧ directory:",
   "tokens": [
    "`RoboTwin/`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 44,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 6950,
   "end": 7002,
   "text": "Add this to your shell profile to make it permanent.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 45,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 7004,
   "end": 7017,
   "text": "## Evaluation",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 46,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 7019,
   "end": 7056,
   "text": "### Standard evaluation (recommended)",
   "tokens": []
